ls area damage and causes knock up  two enemies nearby  in this first scenario kuba karna pushes  middle lane against on who are arriving  from the jungle for a gank the Allied on  who are pins his enemy counterpart with  a shifting sands and impale combo just  as mercury arrives with sonic boom  sending the enemy flying with epic  uppercut Kumba gets the kill in this  second fight khumba karna blinks into  mid lane for a gank sending in box  flying with epic uppercut khumba sets up  Kraken combo for Poseidon as encore  impales the howler monkey God several  additional abilities and a basic attack  by on [ __ ] takedown moonbots in this  final fight Kumba karna secretly watches  as the enemy team goes for the gold fury  blinking in khumba mesmerizes nearby  enemies with mighty yawn sending Agni  flying with epic uppercut Kumba steals  the gold fury with fists of the gods  agnese rough landing aids khumba and  getting a kill as the majority of the  remaining enemies are taken down as the  sleeping giant Kumba karna drowsily  smashes through all who stand in his way  starting him off with throw back can  provide khumba with a hefty kit of a  poke waveclear and - when in a tight  spot next picking up mighty yawn can  make Kula a great asset to his Lane  partner with the mesmerize and slow  potential from there the priority shift  - epic uppercut throw back mighty yawn  groggy strike also introduced in this  patch is the scarlet coven Isis skin  thanks for watching the smite God reveal  for khumba karna the sleeping giant  you
 

